# Data/ holds simulation outputs and machine-local reference parameter files
# (standard_values.json, parameter_specs.json, ...) -- all machine-local,
# none versioned. Pipeline-specific config (e.g. impact_long_shedders'
# SCENARIOS/NSR_RANGES) lives in scripts/experiments/impact_long_shedders_config.py
# instead, as plain code -- not a Data/ reference file.
Data/*
# ...except the real-world inputs Figure 1 reads. These are hand-curated study
# data, not simulation output, and Figure 1 is not reproducible from a clean
# checkout without them. Two of the three are transcribed from publications --
# the literature duration table (panel C, carries DOIs) and the intra-host
# series (panel F, 19 published case reports) -- so they are versioned.
!Data/RealWorldData/

# The global-clock cohort is NOT. It is a sequence-database extract: 1,638
# GISAID-style names with specimen IDs and exact collection dates, feeding
# panels D and E. It was tracked from 2026-06-19 to 2026-10-20 and has been
# purged from the history; keep it out. Obtain it separately and drop it here.
Data/RealWorldData/patient_global_clock.csv
Data/RealWorldData/data_fig1_D.csv

# Archives produced by package_simplicity_data.sh / archive_paper_runs.sh.
# Multi-GB, regenerable from Data/.
Data_Export/
